{
  "name": "DictIsItemKeepsNoOrder",
  "comment": "A dict is `: item` AND still rejects ordering — `item` carries no IOrderableValue\nto leak in. sort over a list-of-dict is unorderable; PLang returns that as an error\n(not a thrown exception), so the on-error handler catches it.",
